tion/problem "$1.2-5=${{field-1}}"] ["question-e12935f7-7208-5953-a547-9693833e1308" :question/worked-solution "Since $5$ is larger than $1.2,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem, which is to carry out the subtraction in the reverse order:\n\n$$\n5-1.2=3.8\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n1.2-5=-3.8.\n$$"] ["question-e12935f7-7208-5953-a547-9693833e1308" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-f248478f-3341-58c6-9f8c-098a17912162" :answer-field/id #uuid "f248478f-3341-58c6-9f8c-098a17912162"] ["answer-dca033f0-f14b-5230-bf01-67d043b720cc" :answer/id #uuid "dca033f0-f14b-5230-bf01-67d043b720cc"] ["answer-dca033f0-f14b-5230-bf01-67d043b720cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dca033f0-f14b-5230-bf01-67d043b720cc" :answer/value "-3.8"] ["answer-field-f248478f-3341-58c6-9f8c-098a17912162" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-f248478f-3341-58c6-9f8c-098a17912162" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-f248478f-3341-58c6-9f8c-098a17912162" :answer-field/correct "answer-dca033f0-f14b-5230-bf01-67d043b720cc"] ["answer-field-f248478f-3341-58c6-9f8c-098a17912162" :answer-field/choices "answer-dca033f0-f14b-5230-bf01-67d043b720cc"] ["question-e12935f7-7208-5953-a547-9693833e1308" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-f248478f-3341-58c6-9f8c-098a17912162"] [17592186179814 :knowledge-point/questions "question-e12935f7-7208-5953-a547-9693833e1308"] ["question-34603e37-b60f-5eb1-996c-5382f05619c6" :question/id #uuid "34603e37-b60f-5eb1-996c-5382f05619c6"] ["question-34603e37-b60f-5eb1-996c-5382f05619c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-155548"] ["question-34603e37-b60f-5eb1-996c-5382f05619c6" :question/problem "![](images/86/867e0d53894e1cacac86120e5c79b32071e2b0a4863b445e6d3492392a59461d.png)\n\nConsider the figure shown above. Which of the following triplets of points are collinear?\n\nI. $M,Q,J$\n\nII. $P,O,L$\n\nIII. $L,O,M$"] ["question-34603e37-b60f-5eb1-996c-5382f05619c6" :question/worked-solution "- $M,Q,J$ are **not** collinear since we can't draw a straight line that passes through all of them.\n\n![](images/7f/7f707d8fbeb9853ccb9441bbdab3b0674c5f51da7f73da73d73ee6592dca04ea.png)\n\n- $P,O,L$ are **not** collinear since we can't draw a straight line that passes through all of them.\n\n![](images/02/028ae56c8a85699d4d6719df2f80a989f1271e392546d005093319af2365675d.png)\n\n \n\n- $L,O,M$ are collinear since there is a straight line that passes through all of them.\n\n![](images/bf/bf0579ecbc33ebe2d97dc1b305de0a89b0c22dadd6a11d0e88ac4a36acbd447f.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\""] ["question-34603e37-b60f-5eb1-996c-5382f05619c6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-120ed5ca-accb-5a8e-8311-e6ba2c45c2e5" :answer-field/id #uuid "120ed5ca-accb-5a8e-8311-e6ba2c45c2e5"] ["answer-09c7191f-9231-5628-b2be-151f0fe75054" :answer/id #uuid "09c7191f-9231-5628-b2be-151f0fe75054"] ["answer-09c7191f-9231-5628-b2be-151f0fe75054" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-09c7191f-9231-5628-b2be-151f0fe75054" :answer/value "I and II only"] ["answer-af88dc91-36a7-5516-bde0-5fb4f3671912" :answer/id #uuid "af88dc91-36a7-5516-bde0-5fb4f3671912"] ["answer-af88dc91-36a7-5516-bde0-5fb4f3671912" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-af88dc91-36a7-5516-bde0-5fb4f3671912" :answer/value "I only"] ["answer-5207156e-3306-5267-bf27-448383fe284d" :answer/id #uuid "5207156e-3306-5267-bf27-448383fe284d"] ["answer-5207156e-3306-5267-bf27-448383fe284d" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-5207156e-3306-5267-bf27-448383fe284d" :answer/value "II and III only"] ["answer-85523798-fbc8-51c4-81ec-a6fd45f4f5f6" :answer/id #uuid "85523798-fbc8-51c4-81ec-a6fd45f4f5f6"] ["answer-85523798-fbc8-51c4-81ec-a6fd45f4f5f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-85523798-fbc8-51c4-81ec-a6fd45f4f5f6" :answer/value "II only"] ["answer-46afe266-