 connects them.\n\nFrom the diagram, we see that the length of the segment is $3$ units, so the distance equals $3.$\n\n![](images/66/66543bc73667ed70a965db4af2e657ad991660fc1b3a73a6e585943deffd3bbb.png)\n\n**Method 2**\n\nWe can find the distance between the two points by finding the distance of each point from the $x$-axis and then subtracting.\n\n![](images/5d/5ded01b570e62d1e206aa8abd1012121367e60e749d441eb4e6ec7e3b12f6e8a.png)\n\nThe point $(0,5)$ is at a distance of $5$ from the $x$-axis, and the point $(0,2)$ is at a distance of $2$ from the $x$-axis. Therefore, the distance between the two points is $5-2=3.$"] ["question-23bd23d2-9b32-5ac7-a70a-faac16c61773" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-6a86050d-8890-58f8-9edb-a6ea2587521d" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a86050d-8890-58f8-9edb-a6ea2587521d"] ["answer-78fb9bb8-f5cd-579b-8da8-ad29d8ac8d2f" :answer/id #uuid "78fb9bb8-f5cd-579b-8da8-ad29d8ac8d2f"] ["answer-78fb9bb8-f5cd-579b-8da8-ad29d8ac8d2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-78fb9bb8-f5cd-579b-8da8-ad29d8ac8d2f" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-8f773a58-226e-501c-8fe2-a236b4c4f65a" :answer/id #uuid "8f773a58-226e-501c-8fe2-a236b4c4f65a"] ["answer-8f773a58-226e-501c-8fe2-a236b4c4f65a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8f773a58-226e-501c-8fe2-a236b4c4f65a" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-b0dc1b05-f0bd-55da-a84f-44cdc160d318" :answer/id #uuid "b0dc1b05-f0bd-55da-a84f-44cdc160d318"] ["answer-b0dc1b05-f0bd-55da-a84f-44cdc160d318" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b0dc1b05-f0bd-55da-a84f-44cdc160d318" :answer/value "4"] ["answer-79cf0447-e1e6-5819-a545-67c520d7fb14" :answer/id #uuid "79cf0447-e1e6-5819-a545-67c520d7fb14"] ["answer-79cf0447-e1e6-5819-a545-67c520d7fb14" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-79cf0447-e1e6-5819-a545-67c520d7fb14" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-22e3e76f-dc9c-57b8-8257-1bd0e126870c" :answer/id #uuid "22e3e76f-dc9c-57b8-8257-1bd0e126870c"] ["answer-22e3e76f-dc9c-57b8-8257-1bd0e126870c" :answer/type :